# Temperance Remade's ice-core store (CIPlay temperance_remade_cave, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# Points as in its recipe: the new pad at 72 -38 (r 22, 3 m), the bridge from the old pad at 44..54 -38, the cave mouth at 56 -38
# (kit_st yaw 90, len 14.5, size 0.7), the sign at 53 -30, the den round 80 -38 with the weather team's chest. Pad height 3 is
# set by the flatten (floor ~3); the room's real position (end + ~10 m) is a GUESS to confirm with a surface probe.
island Temperance Remade keep
offset -6.2505 -9.4792
hour 11
weather Calm

picture te_ice_out 48 6 -26 58 3 -38
read ICE-CORE STORE
walk 46 -38 to 56 -38 to 66 -38 to 76 -38 to 80 -37 below=8
picture te_ice_in 70 3.5 -38 82 3 -38 light=20
open Ice-core chest
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
walk 80 -37 to 70 -38 to 56 -38 to 46 -38 below=8
picture te_ice_mouth 40 5 -34 56 3 -38
